{"id":"en_love-that-never-fades","title":"Love That Never Fades","titleEn":"Love That Never Fades","description":"What does love truly mean? For Song Muye and Shen Tang, it becomes clear when their paths cross once more after five years apart. Love lives in the silences between them, in the untruths they felt forced to tell, each one leaving its own wound. It also lives in a single declaration: that Tang Tang is the only one he wants. Against the vastness of the world, the only thing worth asking for is the person you love. Those wanting to follow this story can do so on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/love-that-never-fades/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/love-that-never-fades/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Sacrificing for Love","Second Chance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4g0k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_love-that-never-fades_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4g0k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-that-never-fades_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4g0k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-that-never-fades_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4g0k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-that-never-fades_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4g0k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-that-never-fades_5","titl